  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AMREF TANZANIA 2010 - 2013</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">AMREF TANZANIA 2010 - 2013</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet kommer att fasas ut i september 2015. Under utfasningen avser AMREF SRHR fr&#xe4;mja och konsolidera en h&#xe5;llbar utveckling av ungdomars sexuella och reproduktiva h&#xe4;lsa. F&#xf6;r att ta itu med viktiga omr&#xe5;den som &#xe4;r relevanta f&#xf6;r &#xf6;kad j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet och st&#xe4;rkt SRHR-perspektiv kommer detta arbete att inneb&#xe4;ra b&#xe4;rkraftigt kapacitetsh&#xf6;jande och s&#xe4;krade positiva f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar inom offentliga strukturer och det civila samh&#xe4;llets organisationer.

Summary 
The project will be phased out by September 2015. During the phaseout period, the AMREF SRHR for young people project intends to consolidate and promote sustainability of young people&apos;s sexual and reproductive health concepts and services and structures.   In order to address key areas that intend to enhance both the gender and SRHR perspective, this will involve building sustainable capacity and securing positive changes within government structures and civil society organisations.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will be phased out by September 2015. During the phaseout period, the AMREF SRHR for young people project intends to consolidate and promote sustainability of young people&apos;s sexual and reproductive health concepts and services and structures.   In order to address key areas that intend to enhance both the gender and SRHR perspective, this will involve building sustainable capacity and securing positive changes within government structures and civil society organisations.</narrative>
  </description>
